<title>USA: Oriole Homes stake held by N.Y. group.</title>
<headline>Oriole Homes stake held by N.Y. group.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1996-11-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>A group led by Tweedy Browne &amp; Co LP, a New York-based broker-dealer, said Tuesday it has acquired a 7.27 percent stake or 199,600 common shares in Oriole Homes Corp.</p>
<p>In a filing with the Securities and Exchange Commission, the group said its stake includes 134,000 shares it bought on November 8 for $7.375 a share.</p>
<p>The group said it holds the stake in the Delray Beach, Fla., developer for investment purposes.</p>
</text>
